description: "Part of build fix-login (repo carousell-web, workspace /fd-home/workspaces/b1111111-0000-4000-8000-000000000001). For work in this build's workspace, use this, not a similarly named skill from elsewhere. Runs this build's flow in plain Claude Code, one step at a time: type /fix-login:run."
