# Run fix-login

Run these steps in order. Only order and hand off: each step goes to its skill or agent; never do a step's work yourself. Wait for each step's result before the next.

Hand-off files are read and written in \`carousell-web/\`, the run's working folder inside this build's workspace, never in the workspace folder itself.

1. NODE p (p): read \`plugin/skills/p/SKILL.md\` by path and follow it. Then go on to NODE a.
2. NODE a (a): dispatch \`fix-login:a\` with the prompt "NODE a\\nGo", and wait for it to return.
